1
00:00:00,932 --> 00:00:04,932
(Howard:)But don't you think it'll be
different when the child is ours?

2
00:00:05,145 --> 00:00:08,605
(Bernadette:)Right. When it's our kid that's ruined
my body, kept me up all night...

3
00:00:08,774 --> 00:00:12,564
...and I've got no career, no future,
nothing to be happy about for 20 years.

4
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:15,326
(Bernadette:)Sure, that'll be completely different.

5
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:20,615
(Howard:)Well, yeah.

6
00:00:25,916 --> 00:00:28,546
(Sheldon:)I don't think there's anything
in this jewelry store...

7
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:33,800
(Sheldon:)...that Amy would appreciate more than
the humidifier we're looking at at Sears.

8
00:00:34,841 --> 00:00:39,181
(Penny:)Oh, my God. Now I know what I sound
Iike to you when I say stupid stuff.

9
00:00:41,765 --> 00:00:43,895
Ooh! A pocket watch.

10
00:00:44,059 --> 00:00:45,939
(Penny:)I don't think Amy
wants a pocket watch.

11
00:00:46,102 --> 00:00:50,062
(Sheldon:)No, but maybe she wants
a man with a pocket watch.

12
00:00:50,232 --> 00:00:53,232
(Penny:)Still saying stupid stuff.

13
00:00:55,237 --> 00:00:58,617
(Penny:)- Does she like bracelets?
- Well, she's very fond of her silver one...

